{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/Headline.png?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend through the twisted levels of the Backrooms using <strong>physics-based object manipulation</strong> to overcome obstacles, <strong>solve mind-bending puzzles</strong>, and <strong>uncover unsettling secrets</strong>. Play solo or team up in <strong>online co-op with up to 4 players</strong> as you climb higher, think smarter, and survive the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/HighlightsGif.gif?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/AscendWithFriends.png?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team up with up to 3 others in online co-op!</strong> Work together to <strong>solve puzzles, move objects, and survive the horrors</strong> that lurk in the shadows. Or go solo for a truly intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/PlayWithFriendsGIF.gif?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/NavigateTheUnkown.png?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your mind to overcome more than just physical obstacles. <strong>Decrypt riddles, unlock paths, and outsmart the strange logic of the backrooms</strong> to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/FaceTheEnemy.png?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>You're not alone.</i></strong> Watch your back as you encounter lurking threats in the dark. Outsmart them, outrun them, or find a way to fight\u2014but remember: they\u2019re always watching.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575300?t=1751353535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/214ebdf05ed16975eba6fd0da8debcdf0ca44852/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751353535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/9c18114b66a2d6325727322ac1a657a8332cdf91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751353535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/9c18114b66a2d6325727322ac1a657a8332cdf91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751353535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/Headline.png?t=1751353535\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend through the twisted levels of the Backrooms using <strong>physics-based object manipulation</strong> to overcome obstacles, <strong>solve mind-bending puzzles</strong>, and <strong>uncover unsettling secrets</stro